  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nThe Camera Drone currently only allows you to move forwards / backwards and left / right (WASD). If you want to go up / down you first need to look in that direction and then move forward (W). This can be a bit annoying and is slow to do.\n# Suggestion:\nWhen using the Camera Drone there should be buttons to move up / down. I could see `CTRL` being used for down and `Space` for up. If you don't want to use `CTRL` you could also use `C` to go down since it's already used for crouching (which moves your view down).",
